			"notes": "### Version 2.5 update\n**[+]** Added the ability to move, resize, etc., the overlay on the ClickGUI screen as well. Previously, this was only possible while on the chat screen.\n\n**[+]** A settings button has been added. Now, by right-clicking the overlay while in the ClickGUI or chat screen, you can adjust the blur and bloom, or detach the \"next song\" element to make it a separate overlay.\n\n<img width=\"984\" height=\"302\" alt=\"Zrzut ekranu 2026-07-14 000156\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d6d37a46-f676-466c-ae64-538af62e1beb\" />"
